B.a0w=new A.ay("lay_on_hands","Lay on Hands","[Action]: Target an Ally within range 1. You may lose HP up to {2 * Source}, and heal the target for twice that amount. Targeted Ally also gains {Source d12} Shield if you lose at least {Source} HP.\n\n[Reaction]: During ally turns when the ally is within range 1, spend your reaction and trigger your Lay on Hands.",B.aH,B.adK,!1,B.ra,!0,null,null)
B.a_7=new A.D("feature_lightning_charger","Charger","You may target yourself or allies with the repeat attack. Instead of damage, give them {Source d6} shield. You may not target yourself or any ally more than once. When you use your reaction, you and allies adjacent to any of the targets gain {Half Source d6} shield.")
