B.a0O=new A.ay("feature_mind_control","Mind Control","[Action] make a Ranged Attack vs Int against 1 enemy range {Source}. On success, for as long as you remain concentrating you are disabled and the target is mind controlled. At the start of their turn, make a status check vs Int, on success you control them on their turn. On failure the enemy is disabled this turn and the effect ends. \n\n[Reaction] When you or an Ally Succeed on an Attack during their turn, Spend your reaction and make a Status Check vs Int. On Success, 1 of the targets is mind controlled as long as you concentrate.",B.R,B.ah7,!1,B.zM,!0,null,null)
B.Xt=new A.D("feature_minkisi_witch_doctor","Witch Doctor","While concentrating, During your turn [Reaction] if the target is under a status effect that requires an ongoing check, have the target immediately make the check with advantage. The target may instead end burn or bleed. If the target is targeted by a poppet ability, the source of the poppet must make a concentration check.")
B.Wr=new A.D("feature_minkisi_witch_trap","Witch Trap","While concentrating, [reaction] when the target fails an Int, Wis, or Cha defense from an attack, you may spend your reaction to have the attacker become the target of the attack instead of the target, suffering the damage and adverse effects from the attack. ")
