B.a1d=new A.ay("feature_mortar","Mortar","[Action] During your or an Ally\u2019s Turns, Spend your reaction and Target a free space range 1 and setup and fire your Mortar. Your mortar counts as a Barrier as if made by a skill, and you may spend supply to do anything but make multiple mortars as if it was a barrier. As long as it lasts, You and your allies can spend a [Reaction] to target a 1 space radius range {Source *3} of the mortar, they make a Ranged Attack vs Dex, and on success deal {Source d8} damage.\n\nCover: [Reaction] After an ally range {2*Source} of your Mortar fails on an attack during their turn, Spend your reaction and make a Ranged Attack vs Dex, On Success deal {Source d8} to enemies in a 1 space radius that contains at least 1 space containing a target of the triggering attack.",B.R,B.ac2,!1,B.eC,!0,null,null)
B.WM=new A.D("feature_mushrooms_Skippers","Skippers","For Enemies, On success Reduce their speed by {Half Source}. For Allies, On Success, Give them {Half Source} additional speed until the start of your turn. You may move your Mushrooms up to {Half Source} Spaces during each of your turns.")
