B.RV=new A.bW("melee_challenger","Challenger","On Player Failure, the target cannot disengage and must include this unit as a target of all attacks or suffer disadvantage on their next turn. On Failure, Target a player that they can see and have them make a Wis defense, On Player Failure, they are challenged as if attacked.",B.c7,B.d6)
